    "detailed_description": "The time of prophecy has come. When reality itself is threatened, the chosen hero begins a journey. What is that hero's name?<br><br><strong>Names are power:</strong> Everyone in the world can namesummon, which means ripping letters out of one's own name and using them as weapons, shields, and tools. Each letter has a different function. With 26 possible abilities, there are practically endless combinations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weaponized Words</h2>You'll encounter many monsters and foes during your quest. Each can be defeated in a variety of ways, so be creative in how you use your name.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/1acdc659f994f7bb344c2ff0fc3aa661.poster.avif?t=1753666640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/1acdc659f994f7bb344c2ff0fc3aa661.webm?t=1753666640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/1acdc659f994f7bb344c2ff0fc3aa661.mp4?t=1753666640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Logical Letters</h2>Names have utility beyond combat. Solve puzzles and navigate past obstacles. No matter which name you pick, there is always a way to move forward.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/338171aa267555d31e48ae40869b7778.poster.avif?t=1753666640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/338171aa267555d31e48ae40869b7778.webm?t=1753666640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/338171aa267555d31e48ae40869b7778.mp4?t=1753666640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Text for Treasure</h2>The Universe is full of secrets and artifacts that may help you during your journey. Build your collection as you explore the Universe's bounds (and beyond).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/514b715727cd8a0b0bebf2910d6f9af5.poster.avif?t=1753666640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/514b715727cd8a0b0bebf2910d6f9af5.webm?t=1753666640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/514b715727cd8a0b0bebf2910d6f9af5.mp4?t=1753666640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Weird World</h2>Meet and befriend eccentric characters. Make impactful choices, and see the different directions this story can take.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/ee6a1b3b017b80ca6d835f3896a84774.poster.avif?t=1753666640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/ee6a1b3b017b80ca6d835f3896a84774.webm?t=1753666640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/ee6a1b3b017b80ca6d835f3896a84774.mp4?t=1753666640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
