deo></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Text for Treasure</h2>The Universe is full of secrets and artifacts that may help you during your journey. Build your collection as you explore the Universe's bounds (and beyond).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/514b715727cd8a0b0bebf2910d6f9af5.poster.avif?t=1753666640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/514b715727cd8a0b0bebf2910d6f9af5.webm?t=1753666640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/514b715727cd8a0b0bebf2910d6f9af5.mp4?t=1753666640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Weird World</h2>Meet and befriend eccentric characters. Make impactful choices, and see the different directions this story can take.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/ee6a1b3b017b80ca6d835f3896a84774.poster.avif?t=1753666640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/ee6a1b3b017b80ca6d835f3896a84774.webm?t=1753666640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/ee6a1b3b017b80ca6d835f3896a84774.mp4?t=1753666640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
